      "subject": "Yuda ka kuma",
      "rationale": "Yuda bɛ kuma Matigi la — Misra jamanatigi ye (Yusufu, min tɔgɔ ma fɔ) — a b'a λaH sɔrɔ a bɛ a sintin."
