      "subject": "עבדך \/ עבד",
      "rationale": "עבד dan na dɔɔni fila o kumasen kɔnɔ — Yuda b'a jira ko a bɛ don jonya kɔnɔ — dan na ɲɔgɔnna cogoya mantan Bamanankan na."
    }
  ],
